WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.670
Narrator: President Trump
has directed $12 billion

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:07.820
into a plan to develop a
coronavirus vaccine in record time.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.570
It's called Operation Warp Speed.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.990
The goal? To have 300 million doses

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:17.240
of a safe, effective
vaccine by January of 2021,

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.300
enough to inoculate first responders

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.440
and the highest-risk
groups in the country.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.550
- It's risky, it's expensive,

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:28.040
but we'll be saving
massive amounts of time.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.130
We'll be saving years.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.220
- But the pressure to get it out

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:34.730
is forcing pharma companies
to rush through steps.

00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:36.840
That's dangerous because it could result

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:40.310
in a product that causes side
effects or just doesn't work.

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:41.670
And the lack of transparency

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:43.490
on how this money is being spent,

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:48.073
and how decisions are being
made, worries some experts.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.100
- Operation Warp Speed is trying

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:54.659
to move as quickly as they
can to develop a vaccine.

00:00:54.659 --> 00:00:56.040
And there's always a balance there between

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.410
how much you inform the
public along the way

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.861
and actually move forward with a program.

00:01:00.861 --> 00:01:03.780
- Congress is also concerned,
and recently launched

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:06.650
an investigation into
Operation Warp Speed.

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:09.220
More details about the program
have started to emerge,

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:12.470
but only after key decisions were made.

00:01:21.299 --> 00:01:24.230
- And nearly everything about
this effort is unprecedented.

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:25.980
Creating a new vaccine has always been

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:29.020
a long, complicated, and expensive process

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.730
that can sometimes take up to a decade.

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.270
Trump indicated that the formula

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:35.930
could be finalized as early as October,

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:40.019
which would mean a total
turnaround time of six months.

00:01:40.019 --> 00:01:42.280
- It just doesn't show the respect

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.520
that should be shown to nature,

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.280
which gives it secrets up slowly

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:49.040
and grudgingly and often
with a human price.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:50.640
- A development for a vaccine,

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.450
or any drug that the FDA approves,

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:54.723
typically unfolds in three phases.

00:01:54.723 --> 00:01:56.470
In phase one trials,

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:58.640
researchers must prove
that a vaccine formula

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:02.190
is safe and has a low risk of side effects

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:04.713
in a small group of about 10 to 30 people.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.530
In phase two,

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:10.650
that formula is given to a
larger group from 50 to 300.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.620
The test group for the
third and final phase

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:16.640
for any new vaccine typically
includes 10,000 people.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:19.400
In July, two Operation
Warp Speed companies,

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:21.073
Moderna and Pfizer BioNTech,

00:02:21.073 --> 00:02:25.710
entered phase three trials
with 30,000 volunteers.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:27.889
It's an extraordinarily large size group,

00:02:27.889 --> 00:02:29.900
since the goal is to make this vaccine

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.610
available to all Americans.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.190
Phase three is crucial
because it shows how a vaccine

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:38.590
will affect the widest cross
section of the population.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.950
- As long as there's this commitment

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:44.660
not to rush the phase
three clinical trials,

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.610
I think everything should be fine.

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:51.210
- Officially Operation Warp
Speed isn't skipping steps,

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.570
but shortening their length

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:55.413
while funding multiple
simultaneous trials.

00:02:55.413 --> 00:02:57.960
And the mystery of Operation Warp Speed

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.290
shrouds how it's funded.

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:02.630
Around $12 billion have
already been committed

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.230
to six vaccine candidates,

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:05.920
including household pharma brands

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:09.690
like Johnson and Johnson,
Pfizer, and AstraZeneca.

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:11.880
Insider recently learned
that government scientists

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:15.720
winnowed a list of nearly
100 vaccines to just 10.

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.140
But the White House has not released

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.810
a complete list of companies
that have received funding

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:22.370
or exactly how they're being selected.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.010
Moderna, a lesser known company

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.960
before it entered the vaccine race,

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.270
has received two rounds of investment,

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.970
about $2.5 billion in total.

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:32.990
The startup is the first
Warp Speed finalist

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:34.870
to reach phase three trials.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.560
Their technology platform has never

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.710
successfully brought a drug to market.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:39.930
In case you missed that,

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.970
the company leading the vaccine race

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:44.900
has never made an FDA-approved drug.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:47.258
That's not uncommon for
a new biotech company,

00:03:47.258 --> 00:03:49.220
and the federal government supported

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:52.110
Moderna's platform even
before the pandemic.

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:55.100
But the company does have
another potential advantage.

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.210
It's connection to the head

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:59.070
of Operation Warp Speed, Moncef Slaoui.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:01.740
- Moncef Slaoui came over after serving

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:02.920
on the board of Moderna

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.050
to run this operation as a contractor.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.990
This has led some people
to have skepticism

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:08.899
around his ties to the industry

00:04:08.899 --> 00:04:11.540
and the potential for him to
have conflicts of interest.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.100
- Slaoui, a former pharma executive

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.310
and venture capitalist,

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.070
stepped down from the board of Moderna,

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:21.153
which has seen stock prices
triple since January.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:33.860
- And Slaoui has another

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.500
close relationship with another

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.140
Warp Speed company: his former employer,

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:40.660
GlaxoSmithKline, or GSK.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:44.264
In July, GSK received
a $2.1 billion grant,

00:04:44.264 --> 00:04:47.827
the largest single investment
under the program to date.

00:04:47.827 --> 00:04:50.785
As of May, Slaoui owned over $10 million

00:04:50.785 --> 00:04:53.170
in shares of the company's stock.

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:55.320
Even with all this money and effort,

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:58.720
there's a chance a
vaccine will never happen.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.090
Other types of coronavirus,

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:03.660
such as MERS and SARS, have
been known for decades.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.470
No vaccine has ever been approved

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.620
for use in the US against these strains.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.990
And researchers are still
trying to figure out how people

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:13.990
develop COVID-19 immunity
and how long it lasts.

00:05:24.437 --> 00:05:26.970
- But even if scientists
can unlock those secrets,

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.140
the plan for how the government

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.310
will deliver a vaccine
to hundreds of millions

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:32.313
of Americans remains unclear.

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:35.210
- There are very few
pharmaceutical companies

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:37.222
that have the manufacturing capabilities

00:05:37.222 --> 00:05:40.283
and expertise to ramp up
the process so quickly,

00:05:40.283 --> 00:05:42.780
and at these massive scales.

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.410
- And for Operation Warp Speed,

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:47.000
there's still one major known unknown:

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.043
Will people take it?

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.030
The last time the federal government

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.900
funded a mass immunization
campaign for a new virus,

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.280
it did not go according to plan.

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:58.870
In February 1976,

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:01.860
after a US soldier died from
a new strain of swine flu,

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:02.900
the government orchestrated

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.313
a $137 million public
immunization campaign.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:08.900
But the pandemic never came

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:11.140
and research showed that
the swine flu vaccine

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.630
may have made some people sick

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:15.040
with a rare autoimmune disorder.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.330
It's an incident that
anti-vaxxers point to

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.900
as proof that all vaccines are unsafe

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.930
and that the government can't
be trusted to develop them.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:26.030
It's an opinion that's
amplified by social media.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:28.530
Recent surveys indicate
that just half of Americans

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.160
plan to get a coronavirus vaccine.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:34.170
Some speculate that
anti-vaccine disinformation

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:35.850
may convince enough people that

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:38.790
it could derail efforts
around a coronavirus vaccine.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:41.380
- I think most people
are vaccine skeptics,

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.213
as they should be.

00:06:42.213 --> 00:06:43.110
I think you should be skeptical

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.660
of anything you put in your body.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:46.040
I think it's such a small percentage

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.970
of people who are vaccine cynics.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.580
- Some are treating misinformation

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:51.590
as its own kind of infection.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:55.750
- It's over double the
amount of information online

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:56.860
than it was in December.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:59.207
In a pandemic, you need
the right information.

00:06:59.207 --> 00:07:01.600
And if you look for
information about vaccines

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.320
on social media sites or on websites,

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:06.560
the misinformation finds you.

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:07.780
- Search engines are likely

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.860
to recommend conspiracy theory videos

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.590
about 5G or Bill Gates.

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.350
It's much harder to get accurate

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:17.220
science-based information to go viral.

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:20.360
Just look at how quickly masks
became a polarizing issue.

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.270
There is concern that
the Trump administration

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:25.560
could attempt to similarly
politicize the vaccine,

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:28.037
setting up an October
surprise announcement

00:07:28.037 --> 00:07:31.040
just in time for the
presidential election.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.152
- Can you assure the
American people that politics

00:07:33.152 --> 00:07:35.480
and consideration around the election

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:37.810
will not interfere with the science?

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.410
- We want to make people better.

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:42.400
We want to send them to the
areas that most need it.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.970
And I think we're going to
have something very soon.

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.460
It's going good.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.513
- Science shouldn't be political.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.608
In the case of vaccines,

00:07:50.608 --> 00:07:52.986
we should allow this process to proceed

00:07:52.986 --> 00:07:55.680
the way that it's proceeded
for the last 70 years,

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.450
which is to say, phase one, phase two,

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.210
phase three trials, and then licensure.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:01.870
- Operation Warp Speed is a gamble

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.730
with incredibly high stakes:

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:06.810
the reopening of the
economy, the 2020 election,

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:09.660
and the promise of a
return to a new normal.

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:10.830
- There's so much urgency

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:12.690
on this moment to have a vaccine

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:15.340
where if the science doesn't live up

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.350
to the political expectations
around these programs,

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.340
it's hard to imagine what would happen

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:22.040
if these vaccines just don't work.

